VALUES ('2571354d-ce6b-5724-8d40-b494355ae7c8', 'bus_asset_class', 'Asset Class', 'A governed classification defining accounting, depreciation, lifecycle, and control defaults for Assets. Provide canonical enterprise semantics for AssetClass. A governed classification defining accounting, depreciation, lifecycle, and control defaults for Assets. Used in asset, maintenance, treasury, banking, credit-risk, accounting, integration, and audit workflows where applicable. Connects operational or financial lifecycle evidence to canonical masters while keeping accounting, bank, and physical records authoritative in their own domains. Created under governed conditions, progressed or finalized with audit history, and corrected through explicit subsequent evidence. Asset lifecycle, maintenance, treasury operations, bank reconciliation, lending, accounting, reporting, and audit. Enterprise fixed assets, equipment reliability, bank close, FX, deposits, interest, and secured lending.', 'A', FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, 'a17c2e00-772c-5837-9f96-8550724aa020', 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
