VALUES ('a4689981-0839-5b39-b982-512efdf7018e', 'Asset Transfer', 'Maintain Asset Transfer records', 'Create, find and maintain Asset Transfer records. The list shows every Asset Transfer you have access to — select a row to open it, or use New to add one. Each row is a single Asset Transfer, described by 3 fields.

Id is unique: no two Asset Transfer records may share the same value, and a save that would duplicate one is rejected. Asset must be filled in before the record can be saved.

